WEBVTT

00:49:58.792 --> 00:50:01.643
you know, that's a whole new
set of expectations.

00:50:01.667 --> 00:50:03.976
And that's why we suddenly
have the permission

00:50:04.000 --> 00:50:07.434
to talk about work
that transports you, right?

00:50:07.458 --> 00:50:10.851
But the concept was
that it transcends you, it elevates you,

00:50:10.875 --> 00:50:14.226
it takes you above the ordinary
into something bigger

00:50:14.250 --> 00:50:18.434
and things that people used to attribute
to religious experiences.

00:50:18.458 --> 00:50:21.934
And now we want that immersive, you know,

00:50:21.958 --> 00:50:25.476
all-encompassing thing in what we do.

00:50:25.500 --> 00:50:29.268
I don't think of it as good or not good,
I just think it's super interesting.

00:50:29.292 --> 00:50:31.934
And it's actually
a wonderful new permission